{
  "id": "nist_800_53",
  "label": "NIST SP 800-53 Rev. 5",
  "coverage_note": "Indicative mapping only, not a NIST-endorsed crosswalk. All 43 posture checks are grouped under 18 SP 800-53 Rev. 5 controls across the AC, AU, CM, IA, SC and SI families -- control IDs and titles are the stable, canonical Rev. 5 catalogue entries, not version-sensitive the way CIS sub-section numbers are. A single host-level, network-facing configuration check is rarely sufficient on its own to fully satisfy a control that in a real ATO also requires organizational policy, procedural, and multi-system evidence NetAudit cannot see. Treat 'pass' here as 'the narrow technical signal this tool can observe was favorable', not 'the control is fully satisfied'.",
